Package: nutrientengine
Type: Package
Title: Evidence Explorer for Nutrient Interactions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Kan-sar", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "67511298+Kan-sar@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Validates chronological nutrient events, matches a small curated
    human-study evidence catalog, and returns transparent interaction findings
    and JSON. Provides exploratory plots without assuming unmeasured absorption.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports: jsonlite
Suggests: shiny, plumber, renv
